# Ignore Smart Environment folder
.smart-env

# This repo is PUBLIC (github.com/yousefamar/foam). Vault content is NOT versioned
# here (*.md above; Syncthing + sources/ digests are the record) — only site code
# is. Everything under root/ except the three tracked symlinks is private by
# default, whatever its extension: project data, scratch, bookmarks, uploads.
# Add an un-ignore line only for site code, never for content.
root/*/
!root/_data/
!root/_includes/
!root/_layouts/

# Private build config and local tooling state
.eleventyignore
.claude/
*.log
